              "explanation": "Synchronous REST calls between microservices create fragile dependency chains where a failure in one service cascades through the system. Message brokers (RabbitMQ, Apache Kafka) decouple services by introducing persistent message queues: publishers emit domain events, and consumers process messages asynchronously at their own pace with guaranteed delivery.",
